@startuml LICP_Sequence_Login_Simple
scale 0.9
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant UI
participant API
database DB

User -> UI : Enter email + password
UI -> API : POST /auth/login
API -> DB : Find user
DB --> API : User record

alt Invalid login
  API --> UI : Error 401
else MFA required
  API --> UI : Request MFA code
  User -> UI : Enter MFA
  UI -> API : POST /auth/mfa/verify
  API -> DB : Validate + create session
  API --> UI : JWT token
else Login OK
  API -> DB : Create session
  API --> UI : JWT token
end

UI --> User : Open role dashboard

@enduml
